From: NWA50BE OpenWrt Project <noreply@invalid.example>
Subject: [PATCH] rpcd: update to Git HEAD (2026-10-04)
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

Take rpcd from openwrt-25.12 (d9178efb38, Git HEAD 2026-10-04, d99f703)
instead of 25.12.3's 2025-12-03 (ffb9961). The upstream range includes,
among others: file: re-authorize the ACL against the resolved path
(symlink bypass, e37ed9d), file: no uninitialized stack memory for
broken symlinks (ab6549a), rc: list name filter use-after-free (0de6668),
exec: async reply teardown use-after-free (e655a0d), plugin: snprintf in
the ubus lookup callback (680705e), integer overflow fixes in session
timeouts and uci apply timeouts, and session: stop naming runtime files
after the session id (d99f703). rpcd is what LuCI calls over ubus.

TIP's 100-guard-he-eht-fields.patch is replaced by the refresh TIP made
for this rpcd source in v5.2.0-rc1 (33718fbf, patch 0133); the old one
does not apply to it.

---
 package/system/rpcd/Makefile                    |  6 +++---
 .../rpcd/patches/100-guard-he-eht-fields.patch  | 17 +++++------------
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

